      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I think the best weapon of a bandit is\r\ndefinitely their \"legs\".",
        "Jp" : "盗賊の武器はやっぱり\r\n\"あし\"だと思うんでさ"
